ory of guns with unlimited ammo all from the flick of the wrist.\nExperience your dream zombie scenario and mow down rabid hot dogs in the mall in this fast paced shoot\u2019em up.\n\nAttack of the snacks is the official outlet for those who are trying to fight back against unhealthy snacks. This is the first game release for Fishermen Labs, LLC.", "short_description": "Junk food has never been more dangerous. Grab your favorite weapon and get to work to do your part for a healthier tomorrow. Be the hero for all vegetable-kind. "}]}, "developer_name": "Fishermen Labs, LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fishermenlabs.com/ar-vr/attackofthesnacks/privacy-notice/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.fishermenlabs.com/ar-vr/attackofthesnacks/termsofuse/", "publisher_name": "Fishermen Labs, LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.fishermenlabs.com/ar-vr/attackofthesnacks", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "296949269197870"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "5117626718331487", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "12334475638